  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sky-villages-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">正在尋找 Forge 版本嗎？點擊此處獲取！</a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SiO5ANY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"439\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?color=blueviolet&label=Discord&logo=Discord&logoColor=blueviolet&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"187\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/LunaPixelStudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=LunaPixelStudios&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"172\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?color=blue&label=Follow&logo=Twitter&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"127\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sky-villages-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FORGE-Version-black?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"137\" height=\"26\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">沒錯，就是這樣！雲海中的村莊！探索天空中大而美麗的村莊吧！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這些村莊會完全隨機生成於你的世界中，每個空中小鎮都會擁有獨特的外觀！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組目前正在穩定開發中。每次更新都會新增新的村莊／內容。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Fabric)</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>相容性資料包</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">資料包允許您以特定方式修改此模組。所有內容均可更改和設定。相容性資料包會將其他模組的方塊、物品和生物加入其中。要將其加入您的模組包，請安裝 Global Packs 模組並將其放入 resourcepacks 資料夾中。此外，您也可以使用 Paxi 或 Open Loader 確保它們在世界建立時載入。如果您使用的是 CurseForge 啟動器，建議將相容性資料包加入 resourcepacks 資料夾，以便 CurseForge 正確識別。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前提供以下官方相容性資料包（截至 v1.0.4）：</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-waystones-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones x 天空村莊</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-graveyard-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Graveyard x 天空村莊</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-supplementaries-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries x 天空村莊</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-farmers-delight-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight x 天空村莊</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-bakery-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Bakery x 天空村莊</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-vinery-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Vinery x 天空村莊</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-candlelight-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Candlelight x 天空村莊</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-beachparty-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Beachparty x 天空村莊</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-brewery-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Brewery x 天空村莊</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-herbal-brews-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Herbal Brews x 天空村莊</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/LunaPixel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ls7ak2O.png\" width=\"1076\" height=\"170\"></strong></a></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>圖片</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s47MBTf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KzcpaYS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aRlKszu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G4BOAHE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EmGry5c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/We7fyp4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"></strong></span></p>",
